b08246132aa7501de18cc372b5", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-9513da3ff07708bac42fa43c", "original_sha256": "328da7e6d864536eda9fed8907e6bf4697955a867550c8f9cb77a8af5c9c6966", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-d69fa44badb18b73abb1e80f", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/252b44b93e3ae36f4113d33ce21a473f1be8d5abf3b7b75bc57640101f6ca62c.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "252b44b93e3ae36f4113d33ce21a473f1be8d5abf3b7b75bc57640101f6ca62c", "user_turn_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 599], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "af90c8feda665f5a5e86bbfe3ce3f51028d13845e316b3eedd7848ca7a01f388", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 229], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "cd3278098d17698ce3c48703362b511162bcc6dbe17b4f0c4e76e35d47d29296", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 49], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "684e7fa15d1ee593215af872fd98ba5ac69f4dcf0d9e4c43b92a0e20c7e5322c", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "**归档附记：本条消息原附件顺序**\n\n1. `assets/29-06_58047_solution_01.png`。\n2. `assets/29-06_58047_question.png`。\n3. `assets/29-06_58047_solution_02.png`。\n\n**对话正文（原文）**\n\n这道题我不知道如何下手。\n\n我倒是得出了所求直线的方向向量是 (-4, -1, 3)。但得到方向向量之后，我还得找直线上的一点，通过点向式来求直线方程，可那个点不好求。\n\n我之前还没利用到“所求直线与已知的两条直线都相交”这个条件。于是我假设并写出了另外两条直线的参数方程：\n\n1. 第一条直线的参数式：x = t - 2, y = 3 - t, z = t - 1\n2. 第二条直线的参数式：x = 2t - 4, y = t, z = 3t + 4\n\n然后我想求所求直线与它们的交点，就把 (-4, -1, 3) 乘到 x、y、z 的表达式里：\n• 第一组得到：-4t + 8, 3 - t, 3t - 3\n• 另一组得到：16 - 8t, t, 9t + 12\n\n我原本以为这样能算出 t 具体是多少，再代回方程求出具体的点。但我后来发现这个 t 根本求不出来，应该是我方法有问题、搞错了。\n\n你看一下？\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.message .assistant #T12}"}